        </td>

        <td class="terms-value">
            :
            180V - 230V ADAPTED TO ALL ELECTRICITY
            ENVIRONMENT &amp; SERVO STABILIZER COMPULSORY
        </td>

    </tr>


    <tr>

        <td class="terms-label">
            SERVICE &amp; WARRANTY
        </td>

        <td class="terms-value">
            :
            <b>
                6 MONTHS FREE SERVICE AND 1 YEAR WARRANTY
                (FOR MANUFACTURING DEFECTS ONLY).
            </b>
        </td>

    </tr>


    <tr>

        <td class="terms-label">
            COMMISSIONING &amp; SCOPE
        </td>

        <td class="terms-value">
            :
            COMMISSIONING IS FREE; MACHINE UNLOADING CHARGES,
            TECHNICIAN FOOD &amp; ACCOMMODATION WILL BE UNDER
            CUSTOMER SCOPE.
        </td>

    </tr>


    <!-- ========================================================
         BANK DETAILS
         ======================================================== -->

    <tr class="section-heading-row">

        <td colspan="2">
            BANK DETAILS :
        </td>

    </tr>


    <tr>

        <td class="terms-label">
            ACCOUNT NAME
        </td>

        <td class="terms-value">
            : SREE CHAKRA SEWING SYSTEMS
        </td>

    </tr>


    <tr>

        <td class="terms-label">
            ACCOUNT NO
        </td>

        <td class="terms-value">
            : 05550500002079
        </td>

    </tr>


    <tr>

        <td class="terms-label">
            BANK NAME
        </td>

        <td class="terms-value">
            : BANK OF BARODA
        </td>

    </tr>


    <tr>

        <td class="terms-label">
            BRANCH
        </td>

        <td class="terms-value">
            : PONMENI
        </td>

    </tr>


    <tr>

        <td class="terms-label">
            IFSC CODE
        </td>

        <td class="terms-value">
            : BARB0POONME
        </td>

    </tr>


    <tr>

        <td class="terms-label">
            ACCOUNT TYPE
        </td>

        <td class="terms-value">
            : CC
        </td>

    </tr>


    <!-- ========================================================
         SIGNATURE
         ======================================================== -->

    <tr>

        <td colspan="2">

            <table class="signature-table">

                <tr>

                    <td style="width:50%; text-align:left;">

                        ACCEPTED<br>
                        (COMPANY SEAL WITH SIGN)

                    </td>


                    <td style="width:50%; text-align:right;">

                        FOR SREE CHAKRA SEWING SYSTEMS<br>
                        AUTHORISED SIGNATURE

                    </td>

                </tr>

            </table>

        </td>

    </tr>

</table>

</div>

<!-- ============================================================
     FOOTER
     ============================================================ -->

<div id="footer-html">

<img
    src="{{ frappe.utils.get_url() }}/files/Footer.jpg.jpeg"
    alt="Company Footer"
>

</div>
